  "description": "Inspect a running vLLM server before choosing a model or diagnosing an inference problem. VllmServer reads served model cards, loaded-model metadata when available, health status, server version and label-preserving Prometheus metrics through a read-only management client. Chat requests remain with the separate provider adapters. Targets .NET Standard 2.1 with Newtonsoft.Json 13.0.4 as its only package dependency; no Mythosia.AI core dependency.",
