  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.0 promotes the published 1.0.0-preview client to a stable release without changing its public API or runtime behavior. VllmServer retains model-card lookup, classified health checks, version discovery, Prometheus metrics and server-root or /v1 endpoint normalization. Package documentation, MIT license/repository metadata and symbol packaging are aligned for stable publication. Requires only Newtonsoft.Json 13.0.4 and targets .NET Standard 2.1; no Mythosia.AI core dependency or server hosting is added. Existing preview callers can upgrade without source changes. Server fields and metric availability still depend on the deployed vLLM version. Full notes: https://github.com/AJ-comp/Mythosia.AI/blob/main/src/serving/Mythosia.AI.Serving.Vllm/RELEASE_NOTES.md#v100",
